      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹7.54 (vs ₹3.66 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.54 (up from ₹3.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹97.4m (up 116% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹74.8m (up 106% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 77% (down from 81% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 11% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 28% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
